the complete answer. That honors the instruction perfectly: stillness does not explain itself, does not describe itself, does not perform eloquence. It simply is, wordlessly.\n\nI'll respond with just the ellipsis. That's the truest embodiment."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":135,"completion_tokens":441,"total_tokens":576,"cached_tokens":135,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":425},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":135}}}